<title>FRANCE: EU rejects bids for Greek maize export - ONIC.</title>
<headline>EU rejects bids for Greek maize export - ONIC.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday rejected bids to export Greek maize to non-EU countries, France's grain office ONIC said.</p>
<p>In November the EU opened a special tender for the export of 100,000 tonnes of Greek maize. The tender expires in May 1997.</p>
<p>The measure is aimed at providing an outlet for excess production in northern Greece and avoid sales to intervention stores. --Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
